# PR draft → ready

Create PRs as **Draft** by default. After demo + [obsidian-pr-ship-sync](../skills/obsidian-pr-ship-sync/SKILL.md), **hand off in Draft** unless the user asked to mark Ready.

When marking **Ready for review** is requested:

1. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — full body + embedded media + **What to look for** bullets.
2. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — **`draft: false`** only after step 1.

Do not mark Ready with stale copy or embeds from an older recording.

**Related:** [pr-product-demos](../.cursor/rules/pr-product-demos.mdc), [obsidian-cloud-vm-demos](../skills/obsidian-cloud-vm-demos/SKILL.md), [obsidian-agent-ui-demo](../skills/obsidian-agent-ui-demo/SKILL.md).
